          "source": "",
          "thread": "Spark Liquidity Layer integrations",
          "why": "The SLL's string of nine-figure deals (Ethena $1.1B, Aave $1.5B, PayPal $1B, USDT/Curve) made it the clearest signal that Spark was becoming stablecoin plumbing, not just a lending fork."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "Capital rotation from Aave",
          "why": "Back-to-back headlines about $10B leaving Aave and Spark TVL spiking after the rsETH exploit drew readers watching which protocol wins when a competitor stumbles."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "Spark airdrop and token",
          "why": "Two distinct airdrop headlines — Ignition check eligibility and the live drop — generated combined clicks that show airdrop-hunters treating Spark as an active opportunity."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "Spark as MakerDAO SubDAO pioneer",
          "why": "Readers engaged with Spark's governance identity — its SubDAO structure, MakerDAO Endgame positioning, and Rune Christensen's strategic commentary — as a model for how DAOs can spin off execution arms."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "Institutional pivot away from retail app",
          "why": "The pivot headline — Spark dropping its crypto app to chase PayPal-scale deals — crystallized a strategic bet that institutional liquidity infrastructure beats consumer UX, a non-obvious directional call that readers noticed."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "Morpho DDM debt ceiling creep",
          "why": "Sequential 50M DAI ceiling increases on the sUSDe vault (350M → 400M → 450M) were clicked as incremental risk accumulation stories, not routine governance updates."
        }
      ]
    },
